    "markdown": "# Round 2: the harness and its proofs\n\nThe harness renders the app's views on fixtures, under the app's CSP, and **four proofs** read what it drew.\n\n## What changed\n\n- The V07 probe of `app-smoke`, on each engine\n- V08 in every `cargo test`\n- A pseudo-locale, so that a string written in the code *shows*\n\n## Checks\n\n| Proof | Cases | Result |\n|---|---|---|\n| contrast | 30 pairs in 3 directions | none under the threshold |\n| catalog | every view and state | no string outside it |\n\n```sh\nnpm run prove\n```\n\n> The proofs run in Chrome; `app-smoke` runs the V07 check again on each engine.\n\nSee [the run](https://github.com/owner/repo/actions/runs/1), [the notes](https://example.invalid/notes) and ![a chart](https://example.invalid/chart.png).\n\n---\n\n1. Build the harness\n2. Run the proofs\n",
    "name": "demo"
  },
